Gorbunov and Pinsker, Problems of Information Transmission 9 (1973) 184, "Nonanticipatory and prognostic epsilon entropies and message generation rates", and 10 (1974) 93, "Prognostic epsilon entropy of a Gaussian message and a Gaussian source", are the citations carried in the reference lists of the 2018 CDC paper and of 10.1109/tit.2021.3124888. This session did not find a Crossref work record, and so no DOI, for either translation.
